      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū wīta shibi, ūng'hūba SEEBA mu nzīla ya kūnyeekeja ng'wiye mu nyasala sala shikolo īsho walī abīkījiwe nūūlū kūbilisīlwa, nūūlū wiba shikolo, nūūlū ūnembalemba ng'wiye ūnsoja shikolo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ūbona shikolo sha bangī shijimīīlile hūna ūlomaloma, ūleka ū kūhaya ūko shilī, wandya kwilahīla mihayo ya nyalomolomo, akwītaga ūmo banhū bakīītīlaaga, baagwa mu būhūbi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūlū wīta shibi mu mhayo gwabūbi gwa mbika yenīyo, ūbiza wagwa mu kwihīga, akūshishosha īsho wibile, nūūlū īsho wasolile mu nyasala sala, nūūlū īsho walī wabīkījiwa hūna ūshinyeecha; nūūlū īsho shalī shijimīīlile īsho akashibona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū shose shose īsho akashihaya mu būlomolomo ūlahīla na kūlahīla. Ī shikolo shenīsho akūshishosha mu lūshikū lwa kūshifunya ī shakwinha shakwe sha kwihīga; nīyo shibize gīt'ūmo shaalī aho washisolelaga. Hanuma akongeja n'īmò ya itanò ya mpango gwasho, hūna ūng'winha ū ng'wenekīlī shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsango gwakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo gūkūbiza kūfunya ng'ondi ya ng'holo kwīnga ng'widaale lyakwe lya mitugo; ībize ītī na būka, nū mpango gwayo gūbize gwigeleelilwe. Akūyenha kūlī ngabīji, īfunyiwe kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, īfunyiwe kūbiza shakwinha shakwe sha kwihīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nzīla yenīyī ū ngabīji akūmeegeja isangī ū kūlī SEEBA alekejiwa ū būhūbi bokwe ū mu yose īyo walī wayīta, yūng'wenheleja kūgwa mu kwihīga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shitambò sha kūpemva",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiishi shilagīlo ūg'winhe ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe: Ng'wīlage gīkī, “Ī mihayo ya shitambò sha kūpemva īkūja mu kahelele aka. Ī shitambò sha kūpemva, shiigelile kwikala a ha ng'walīlo būjikū pe shilī ha moto, kūshisha ntondo dilū; nū moto gūyūkeeyula gūlībaka ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ngabīji akūzwala ī lishadi lyakwe lya kitaani, nū ng'wenda gwakwe gwa kitaani ū gwa kūtonja mu gatī, hūna akūgīnja a mabu ga shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shajigaga mu moto, ūgasundīla ha mhelo ya ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma akūshizuula ī shizwalo shenīshi ūzwala shingī, hūna ūgasomba a mabu kūja hanze ya ng'hambī, kū ipandī īlo līlemegije banhū kūja ko sagala sagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū moto gwa ha ng'walīlo gwiigelile gwikale gūkūbakaga būlī ikanza, gūtizūjima nūūlū hado. Ū ngabīji akūyūgūsoosela būlī lūshikū ī dilū, oongeja mo nī ng'hwi; nī shitambò īsho shilī a ha moto ūshihela hoi chiza chiza, na a masazu ga shitambò sha būsangī ayo galīho, ūgapemba pye gūūjiga gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū moto gwa ha ng'walīlo gwigelile gūbake būlī gwa, yaya ū kūgūleka gūkajima nūūlū hado.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sha būsu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya shitambò sha kūpemva īkūja mu kahelele kaka; a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni bakūyūmfunīja SEEBA kū būtongi wa ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūsola būsu būnogu būgehu mu nkono gwakwe, hamò na masazu; nū ū būbbani pyī ū bose ūbo būlī a ha shakwinha sha būsu. Hūna ī shikolo shenīsho akūshipemba mu moto gwa ha ng'walīlo; lībize ibbudīka lya shiizūkījo, kūlwa kwenha ng'waso gwawiza gwa kūnyeja SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īsho shilīshiigīīla shikūbiza sha kūlyiwa na Alooni hamò na bitūnja bakwe; alīyo shilī sha kūlyiwa gīko dūhū, yaya kūsanjiwa na shibimbya, nīyo sha kūlīīlwa ng'wipandī lyeela, mu gwalugwa y'iheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A h'ikanza lya kūzugwa shitizūsanjiwa mo shibimbya na hado yaya. Ī shitambò īsho shikafunyiagwa mu nzīla ya moto nabinhaga boi, kūlwa nguno nasho ī shenīsho shilī sheela no no no, gīt'ūmo shilī shitambò īsho shikafunyiagwa kūlwa shibi, na kūlwa kwihīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ose ose ū ngosha ū mu kaya ya ng'wa Alooni ū mu shibyalīlwe ī shose īsho shiliza, azunīlījiwe ū kūshilya; ū gwenūyo gūlī ngabo gwakwe ū mu shitambò īsho shikafunyiagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto. Ose ose ū wa kūshikuumya wigeleelilwe kūbiza ng'wela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
