        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla hangī ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īshi h'ī shakwinha īsho Alooni na bitūnja bakwe bakūng'wenhela ū SEEBA, a ha lūshikū lwa kwitīīlwa maguta ga kūtūūlwa a ha nīmo, īmò y'ikūmi ya efa ya būsu būnogu. Ī shenīshi shikūbiza shakwinha sha būsu sha kūfunyiwa būlī lūshikū; nusu yaho dilū, ī nusu ī yīngī mhīndī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbūguulanya na maguta, hūna ī shakwinha shabo sha būsu būshikalanga h'ikalangīlo, hama būshenha shimenyagūlilwe chiza chiza, būshifunya kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA shibize shakwinha sha ng'waso gwawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja ūyo ahelilwe kūbiza ha nīmo gwa būgabīji hanuma ūlū waacha ū ise, hū ng'wene akūshibeeja ī shakwinha shenīshi. Ū gwenūyū gūlī ngabo go ng'wa SEEBA gwa būlī lūshikū; ī shakwinha shenīshi shilī sha kūpemva shūshila ho gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shakwinha sha būsu īsho akūfunya ngabīji shiigelile kūpemva shishile ho gete; shitī sha kūlyiwa na munhū ose ose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
