        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīlage ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe gīkī, “Yīyī mihayo ya kahelele kūlwa shitambò sha shibi. Ī shitambò sha shibi shiigelile shisīnzwe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ng'wipandī īlo shitambò sha kūpemva shikasīnzīlagwa; ī shoi shilī sheela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji wa kūshifunya hū ng'wene ū wa kūshilya, shilī sha kūlīīlwa ng'wipandī lyeela, mu gwalugwa y'iheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shose shose ī sha kwikuumya nī nyama yenīyo shikūbiza sheela, hama a mininga ga shitambò ūlū gūūsaamukīla ha shizwalo shose shose, shiigelile shifulīlwe ng'wipandī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nungū ja mabūmba ī ja kūtūmamīlwa kwīzuga ī nyama yenīyo shiigelile jibelwe. Alīyo ūlū yūzugīlwa mu shiseme sha shaba, ī shiseme shenīsho ni shiguusagwe mu minzī sheele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyama yenīyo īdūgije kūlyiwa na ngosha ose ose ū wa mu kaya ya ngabīji; ī yoi īlī neela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būlī shitambò sha shibi īsho mininga gasho gakwenhwa ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, kūlwa nguno ya kūbeeja isangī ng'wipandī lyeela, ī shenīsho shitizūlyiwa; shilī sha kūpemva mu moto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.30",
